OpenSimSearch

A search module for OpenSimulator, started in 2008 by Fly-Man- and Melanie Thielker, then maintained by Kevin Cozens
(https://github.com/kcozens/OpenSimSearch) until 2022. This repository is a fork of his, kept by Gudule Lapointe since 2026.

License

The original repository has no license file. Two of its files (webroot/query.php, webroot/wiredux/sites.php) carry the
copyright and license header of the OpenSimulator project, where the module comes from. Following them, this fork distributes
the module under the license of OpenSimulator (BSD 3-Clause, see LICENSE), and its own changes under the same terms.

The other authors have not been asked to confirm. If you are one of them and want something changed, please open an issue.
